# API Changelog 2.0 vs. 2.0


## API Changes

### GET /pets
- :warning: the response property `!tag/anyOf[#/components/schemas/Pet]/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became nullable for the status `204`
- :warning: the response property `items/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became nullable for the status `404` (media type: application/vnd.api+json)
- :warning: the response property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became nullable for the status `404` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
- :warning: the `items/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` response's property `type/format` was widened from `string` to `string, null/byte` for status `404` (media type: application/vnd.api+json)
-  the `!tag/anyOf[#/components/schemas/Pet]/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` response's property `type/format` changed from `string` to `string, null/byte` for status `204` (backward compatible)
-  the `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` response's property `type/format` changed from `string` to `string, null/byte` for status `404` (backward compatible) (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
-  the response required property `!tag/anyOf[#/components/schemas/Pet]/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became not write-only for the status `204`
-  the response required property `items/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became not write-only for the status `404` (media type: application/vnd.api+json)
-  the response required property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became not write-only for the status `404` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)
-  the response write-only property `!tag/anyOf[#/components/schemas/Pet]/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became optional for the status `204`
-  the response write-only property `items/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became optional for the status `404` (media type: application/vnd.api+json)
-  the response write-only property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became optional for the status `404` (media type: application/json; charset=utf-8)


### GET /ünïcode/ключ
- :warning: the response property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became nullable for the status `404`
-  the `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` response's property `type/format` changed from `string` to `string, null/byte` for status `404` (backward compatible)
-  the response required property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became not write-only for the status `404`
-  the response write-only property `名前/items/allOf[subschema #3]/ключ` became optional for the status `404`






